 "remarks": "Looking for a beautifully renovated, move-in-ready home? This could be the one! Bright and spacious second-floor, 2-bedroom, 1-bath apartment with no one above, featuring two generously sized bedrooms with fantastic closet space. Modern kitchen with shaker-style cabinetry, porcelain tile flooring, and stainless steel appliances, fully tiled bath, and gorgeous new red oak hardwood floors throughout. Two reserved parking spaces and coin-operated laundry in the shared basement. Conveniently located near I-95, downtown Stamford, restaurants, shops, public transportation, Cove Island Park, and Chelsea Piers. Heat and hot water included! Tenant pays electric, cooking gas, and cable/internet-good credit and income required.",
